{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/miles_mazy/status/2115006510979801566","id":"2115006510979801566","text":"https://x.com/i/article/2114998201186955265","raw_text":{"text":"https://t.co/SMlDaVDqXv","display_text_range":[0,23],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[0,23],"original":"https://t.co/SMlDaVDqXv","replacement":"https://x.com/i/article/2114998201186955265","display":"x.com/i/article/2114…"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"miles_mazy","url":"https://x.com/miles_mazy","id":"2085020135602208769","followers":35289,"following":627,"likes":7834,"media_count":486,"name":"Miles Ma","description":"- 大厂AI算法专家，26年6月裸辞转型FDE\n- 来X记录转型的一切，2个月3万粉，一周三篇百万长文\n- 专注企业 AI 培训、落地、交付\n- 我的 AI & X增长答疑社群 199🚪V：miles_mzy","raw_description":{"text":"- 大厂AI算法专家，26年6月裸辞转型FDE\n- 来X记录转型的一切，2个月3万粉，一周三篇百万长文\n- 专注企业 AI 培训、落地、交付\n- 我的 AI & X增长答疑社群 199🚪V：miles_mzy","facets":[]},"location":"自用Opus站点 → ","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2085020135602208769/1786297481","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2087768614258798592/qUW6d1cZ_200x200.jpg","joined":"Wed Aug 05 15:11:43 +0000 2026","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://www.aicodemirror.ai/register?invitecode=M24ZON","display_url":"aicodemirror.ai/register?invit…"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":42,"retweets":175,"likes":1112,"bookmarks":2469,"quotes":36,"created_at":"Tue Oct 27 09:03:41 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1793091821,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":155248,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":null,"replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"article":{"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:03:41.000Z","modified_at":"2026-10-27T09:03:41.000Z","id":"2114998201186955265","title":"FDE 实战案例｜数据清洗（海量多模态数据，怎么洗成一套可信数据）","preview_text":"前段时间，我们去一家美妆企业做 FDE 落地。具体业务包括舆情分析、竞品调研、营销活动复盘，以及从评论区里提取用户对功效、肤感、成分、价格和使用场景的真实反馈。","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHVoCBCYXIAAKAAIc73rENBtAAQAA","media_id":"2115005191846043648","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":92.75,"rgb":{"blue":254,"green":254,"red":254}},{"percentage":2.13,"rgb":{"blue":92,"green":47,"red":34}},{"percentage":1.5,"rgb":{"blue":253,"green":194,"red":163}},{"percentage":1.16,"rgb":{"blue":252,"green":101,"red":29}},{"percentage":0.83,"rgb":{"blue":251,"green":138,"red":84}}]},"original_img_height":793,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVoCBCYXIAAcyna.jpg","original_img_width":1983},"media_key":"3_2115005191846043648"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"er4bb","text":"前段时间，我们去一家美妆企业做 FDE 落地。具体业务包括舆情分析、竞品调研、营销活动复盘，以及从评论区里提取用户对功效、肤感、成分、价格和使用场景的真实反馈。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dj01d","text":"项目启动以后，一个很现实的问题摆在面前：小红书、抖音、视频号、微博等平台的数据已经采集回来，但文字、图片、音频和视频混在一起；同一款产品有全名、简称、系列名和用户自己的叫法；原帖、评论和回复之间还要保持完整关联。只要其中一个环节处理错了，后面的用户洞察和报告结论都会跟着跑偏。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bpv5g","text":"现在 AI 的搜索功能已经非常完善，所以这篇文章会从单个项目讲起，再把实际做法整理成一套通用方案。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eo4kg","text":"以后需要分析小红书、抖音、视频号、微博等平台的数据，不管是做消费品洞察、汽车口碑、餐饮选址、旅游评价，还是品牌舆情，都可以参考这套链路完成数据清洗、关系整理、质量核验和入库。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a06os","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ci9nc","text":"整条链路分成八步：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":70,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"ah1bl","text":"定数据规范 → 保留原始内容 → 梳理数据关系 → 多模态归一 → 冲突和质量清洗 → 生成结构化数据 → 执行验收 → 按规则和版本入库。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f7d53","text":"第一步：先定数据规范","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cgbu5","text":"进入项目后，我们都会先问业务团队一句：这批数据最后拿来干什么？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b7s8s","text":"舆情报告要看事件、传播和风险；竞品报告要比较品牌、产品线、功效、成分和用户评价；营销复盘要看渠道、内容、互动和反馈；评论区分析还要保留用户提问、上下文和回复关系。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":13,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"a021","text":"用途不同，清洗方式也不同。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"14dee","text":"比如同一条新品种草素材，被十个账号发布。做传播复盘时，这十次发布都要保留；统计自然讨论时，它们又要被标成同一组重复内容。如果采集后直接删掉九条，后面就没法更换统计口径。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a1sel","text":"所以第一步要写清楚：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7rdck","text":"哪些字段必须保留；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"485hu","text":"帖子、评论和用户怎么关联；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eknl9","text":"哪些判断必须附带原文；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4nvcd","text":"哪些数据可以直接使用；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"em7hk","text":"哪些数据需要人工确认。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fsubp","text":"这就是数据规范。名字不复杂，作用也很直接：先统一规则，再开始处理。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b0kt1","text":"第二步：原始内容永远保留","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7qttn","text":"原文、图片、音频、视频、链接、发布时间和平台原始 ID，都要保留。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f20jb","text":"清洗后的文字单独存，不能覆盖原文。OCR、ASR 和模型生成的标签，也只能作为新增结果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d34de","text":"这样做有三个好处：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2qs04","text":"识别错了，可以回到原内容检查。","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cum3h","text":"换了模型，可以重新处理。","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dc64b","text":"报告里的结论，可以找到对应证据。","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9pn2t","text":"如果只保留模型加工后的结果，后面即使发现错误，也不知道错在采集、识别还是分析。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4vjrg","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9ksku","text":"第三步：把用户、原帖、评论和回复连起来","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6p20e","text":"很多团队只保存作者、正文、时间和互动量。做词频统计勉强够用，分析评论就会失去上下文。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fsffd","text":"一条“这个也太差了”的评论，到底是在评价原帖里的产品，还是在回应上一条评论？要看它挂在哪个 ID 下面。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"57ml3","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ec15o","text":"单个平台内，至少保留四类 ID：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7k4sq","text":"user_id：谁发布了内容；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"953ds","text":"post_id：评论属于哪条原帖；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2st6u","text":"comment_id：当前是哪条评论；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"r77t","text":"parent_comment_id：这条回复在回应谁。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f54li","text":"数据库里的主键可以写成“平台名 + 平台原始 ID”，避免不同平台出现相同编号。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9nvcn","text":"不同平台之间不要直接认人。昵称相同、头像相似，只能当成线索。没有可靠主键和明确授权时，可以汇总话题、对象和内容，不能把两个账号直接拼成一个人的完整轨迹。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":22,"offset":6,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"9h457","text":"一句话概括：平台内把关系梳理清楚，平台间把来源分开保存。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3ot4a","text":"第四步：文字、图片、音频、视频分别处理，再统一格式","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c414q","text":"四种内容的处理方式不同，最后都要整理成一套统一格式：谁在什么时间说了什么，提到了什么对象，证据在原内容的哪个位置。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"uv3a","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fvldr","text":"文字","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e4puk","text":"保留原文，再处理乱码、空白、链接、语言和重复段落。模型提取观点时，要同时返回对应原句。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1dcfa","text":"图片","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3uot5","text":"OCR 提取价格、型号、日期和截图文字；视觉模型识别对象、场景和部件。两种结果都要保留图片位置，方便后面判断文字和对象是否属于同一区域。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1nr5o","text":"音频","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"acs64","text":"先统一格式和采样率，再做 ASR。输出需要带时间码。分析多人对话时，再增加说话人区分；普通口播不需要多做一层。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9h3p5","text":"视频","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"10p97","text":"先拆出音轨和关键帧。音轨做 ASR，关键帧做 OCR 和视觉识别，最后按照时间合并。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b3a23","text":"没有必要逐帧分析整段视频。可以先低频抽帧和全文转写，找到相关片段后，再提高局部抽帧密度。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2jorb","text":"API、本地模型怎么选","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"nnfe","text":"小批量验证可以直接调用 API。数据量稳定以后，再把高频任务搬到本地。常见组合是：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":4,"length":6,"offset":2}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"20t0g","text":"用 FFmpeg 拆音轨、转码和抽帧；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":5,"length":9,"offset":2}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7h6jd","text":"用 PaddleOCR 做本地 OCR；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":6,"length":7,"offset":2}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3dgi5","text":"用 Whisper 做本地语音识别；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":7,"length":9,"offset":10},{"key":8,"length":7,"offset":20}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1bq20","text":"云端 OCR 可以接百度智能云 OCR或腾讯云 OCR；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":9,"length":7,"offset":9},{"key":10,"length":11,"offset":17}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7o9e5","text":"云端语音识别可以接腾讯云 ASR或火山引擎音视频字幕生成。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dks5m","text":"试用额度和并发限制会变化，上线前直接看控制台。选型时也别只看价格，要拿自己的真实样本测试方言、噪声、中英混合、竖屏字幕和截图小字。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5mmnp","text":"任务会反复执行时，可以做一个轻量工作台：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":64,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"b53at","text":"文件或链接进入 → 自动选择 OCR、ASR 或视觉工具 → 查看原文与识别结果 → 人工修正 → 导出 JSON 或 CSV。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dq48t","text":"工作台同时记录调用次数、耗时、费用和失败原因。跑一段时间以后，团队自然知道哪些环节继续用 API，哪些值得本地部署。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":11,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ctc2p","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7i2nm","text":"第五步：数据冲突时，先看证据","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"edu6p","text":"多模态处理经常得到两个都像正确答案的结果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5t7qn","text":"我们碰到过一条视频：ASR 识别成 100，画面 OCR 识别成 11000。如果系统直接选择置信度更高的一方，错误数字会一路进入统计和报告。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ir91","text":"处理这类问题，先给证据分级：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":12,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c07o6","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":3,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"e1cdr","text":"A 级：官方字段或人工确认结果；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":3,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"8dt7f","text":"B 级：原图、原音频、原视频里可以直接确认的内容；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":3,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"f8htb","text":"C 级：多个模型结果一致，上下文也能对上；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":3,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"66q1u","text":"D 级：单个模型的识别或判断；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":3,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"aou2t","text":"E 级：关键词、正则和简单规则给出的候选值。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8e9ci","text":"发现冲突后，按照时间码和图片位置找到原始证据，再核对单位、上下文和发布时间。能确认就修正；暂时确认不了就进入待核队列，不参加精确数值统计。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"11iqb","text":"修正时保留原始值、修正值、证据等级、修正原因、复核状态和模型版本。原值不能被覆盖。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8d41l","text":"第六步：重复、低质量和异常内容分开处理","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ed7mu","text":"公开数据里会有广告、搬运、统一素材、乱码、无关内容和异常互动。这些情况需要分开处理。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cts2s","text":"先筛相关内容。关键词和词典负责尽量找全，语义模型补充简称、缩写和相近说法。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b1k2g","text":"再处理重复内容。完全复制、轻微改写、同图不同文和同视频再发布，都可以放进同一个重复组。原始记录仍然保留，统计时再决定按帖子、素材还是账号去重。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"rntl","text":"最后识别异常。发布时间、内容相似度、账号历史、发帖节奏和互动网络都可以作为判断信号。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2dffn","text":"系统最后输出四种状态：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"99gsa","text":"正常可用；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"32ve3","text":"重复关联；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ito4","text":"低质量，等待修复或隔离；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1ashl","text":"高风险，进入人工复核。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bb3il","text":"风险分只负责把可疑内容排到前面。活动统一素材、媒体矩阵和合作账号也会高度相似，不能看见高分就直接删除。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":13,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a6faq","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8e1s4","text":"第七步：把内容整理成可查询的数据","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9s7b9","text":"清洗完以后，还要把自然内容整理成字段。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d1rbb","text":"比如一位用户说：“这款精华刚涂上挺润，过一会儿有点黏，敏感肌可能要先试一下；同价位我还想看看另一款。”","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4olif","text":"这句话里有当前产品、候选产品、即时肤感、后续肤感、适用人群、风险提醒、价格区间和对比意向。只打一个“负面”或“中性”标签，后面几乎没法使用。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"51gcs","text":"通用的结构可以分成五类：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"aaqko","text":"谁在表达，评价对象是谁；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bhv1g","text":"提到了什么产品、部件、功能或服务；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4qi7u","text":"对象之间发生了什么；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5l9hs","text":"用户的观点、问题和意图是什么；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"chov7","text":"判断依据是哪句原文、哪个图片位置或哪段音频。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"r3a7","text":"高频、规则稳定的任务交给规则和小模型。多语种、多对象、复杂指代和长文本交给大模型。低置信结果进入人工复核。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eb596","text":"大模型需要按照固定 JSON 格式返回字段和证据。字段名称、可选值和空值规则提前写清楚，输出才能直接验收和入库。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ehuba","text":"第八步：验收通过，再按版本入库","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8q4v6","text":"入库前要检查：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ebg3k","text":"原始内容和链接是否完整；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"912j","text":"评论能否回到原帖和上级评论；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9c131","text":"OCR、ASR 和视觉结果是否带位置；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1ahs0","text":"冲突是否有处理状态；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"20v3e","text":"标签是否绑定正确对象；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d5dgq","text":"规则、模型和字段是否有版本号。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f5s7n","text":"团队还要准备一批人工确认过的测试样本，包括正常数据和容易出错的难例。每次换规则、换模型，都用同一批样本重新跑一遍。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e77d3","text":"最后入库时，把原始数据、处理结果、质量状态和版本信息分开保存。这样才能重新处理、对比新旧结果，也能查清一条数据是在哪一步发生了变化。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2c45k","text":"最后带走一套通用方案","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":14,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"blnbl","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":8,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"},{"length":9,"offset":30,"style":"Bold"},{"length":9,"offset":67,"style":"Bold"},{"length":10,"offset":95,"style":"Bold"},{"length":12,"offset":131,"style":"Bold"},{"length":10,"offset":166,"style":"Bold"},{"length":7,"offset":198,"style":"Bold"},{"length":11,"offset":228,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"9a9pj","text":"一，定数据规范。 说清楚用途、字段、关系、证据和入库条件。\n二，保留原始内容。 原文、原文件、链接、平台 ID 和采集时间全部留下。\n三，梳理数据关系。 连好用户、原帖、评论、回复和附件。\n四，完成多模态归一。 文字、图片、音频和视频分别处理，再整理成统一格式。五，做好冲突和质量清洗。 处理识别冲突、重复、缺失、乱码和异常数据。\n六，生成结构化数据。 提取对象、属性、关系、事件、观点和证据。\n七，执行验收。 用人工确认过的样本检查准确率和高风险错误。\n八，按规则和版本入库。 保存处理规则、模型版本、修正原因和处理时间。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"78vb7","text":"一套完整交付还应包括数据字典、关系说明、处理流程、质量报告、难例集、复核队列和版本记录。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":48,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"daqq8","text":"FDE 在这个阶段要做的，就是把业务规则、数据处理、模型能力和人工复核接成一条能长期运行的流程。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bgirm","text":"数据洗干净以后，下一篇再解决数据库查询：面对字段多、层级深的 Elasticsearch，AI 怎样稳定取到正确数据，并把它们写进一份可信报告。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":15,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fnq3e","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"44t0n","text":"我是 Miles，做 AI 算法研发、企业 AI 培训和 FDE 落地交付。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"mentions":[{"fromIndex":4,"text":"miles_mazy","toIndex":15}]},"entityRanges":[{"key":16,"length":11,"offset":4}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6ltua","text":"关注我 @miles_mazy，继续交流企业 AI 的实际做法。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":17,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7tncg","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3vune","text":"","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"12","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"392cbcae-910c-4898-bd17-1ab026995c09","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"5","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2114999268658356224"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"8","value":{"data":{"url":"https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/866/45338"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":"LINK"}},{"key":"4","value":{"data":{"url":"https://ffmpeg.org/documentation.html"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":